{"id":"aa5e97d1038e88b9","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-order11-modular-lattice.md","title":"ZFC Order11 Modular Lattice","display":"df-zfc-order11-modular-lattice — ZFC Order11 Modular Lattice","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order11-modular-lattice","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order11-modular-lattice"],"display":"df-zfc-order11-modular-lattice — ZFC Order11 Modular Lattice","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-poset-lattice.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order11-modular-lattice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order11-modular-lattice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order11-modular-lattice — ZFC Order11 Modular Lattice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"79109424a5779d49\" href=\"?note=79109424a5779d49\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-poset-lattice.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-poset-lattice.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,\\leq,\\wedge,\\vee\\in V\">\\(L,\\leq,\\wedge,\\vee\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\\subseteq L\\times L\">\\(\\leq\\subseteq L\\times L\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11ModularLattice}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11ModularLattice}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"79109424a5779d49\" href=\"?note=79109424a5779d49\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-poset-lattice.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-poset-lattice.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}modular\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11ModularLattice}_S(L,\\leq,\\wedge,\\vee)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S(L,\\leq)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\wedge,L\\times L,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vee,L\\times L,L)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\;\\Bigl(\nx\\wedge y\\leq x\\land x\\wedge y\\leq y\n\\land\\forall u\\in L\\;((u\\leq x\\land u\\leq y)\\to u\\leq x\\wedge y)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{21mm}{}\\land x\\leq x\\vee y\\land y\\leq x\\vee y\n\\land\\forall u\\in L\\;((x\\leq u\\land y\\leq u)\\to x\\vee y\\leq u)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in L\\;\n\\bigl(x\\leq z\\to x\\vee(y\\wedge z)=(x\\vee y)\\wedge z\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}modular\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11ModularLattice}_S(L,\\leq,\\wedge,\\vee)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S(L,\\leq)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\wedge,L\\times L,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vee,L\\times L,L)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\;\\Bigl(\nx\\wedge y\\leq x\\land x\\wedge y\\leq y\n\\land\\forall u\\in L\\;((u\\leq x\\land u\\leq y)\\to u\\leq x\\wedge y)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{21mm}{}\\land x\\leq x\\vee y\\land y\\leq x\\vee y\n\\land\\forall u\\in L\\;((x\\leq u\\land y\\leq u)\\to x\\vee y\\leq u)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in L\\;\n\\bigl(x\\leq z\\to x\\vee(y\\wedge z)=(x\\vee y)\\wedge z\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary modular lattice definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-poset-lattice.md","status":"resolved","id":"79109424a5779d49","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-poset-lattice.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-poset-lattice.md","status":"resolved","id":"79109424a5779d49","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-poset-lattice.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,\\leq,\\wedge,\\vee\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq\\subseteq L\\times L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11ModularLattice}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}modular\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11ModularLattice}_S(L,\\leq,\\wedge,\\vee)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S(L,\\leq)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\wedge,L\\times L,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vee,L\\times L,L)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\;\\Bigl(\nx\\wedge y\\leq x\\land x\\wedge y\\leq y\n\\land\\forall u\\in L\\;((u\\leq x\\land u\\leq y)\\to u\\leq x\\wedge y)\\\\\n&\\hspace{21mm}{}\\land x\\leq x\\vee y\\land y\\leq x\\vee y\n\\land\\forall u\\in L\\;((x\\leq u\\land y\\leq u)\\to x\\vee y\\leq u)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in L\\;\n\\bigl(x\\leq z\\to x\\vee(y\\wedge z)=(x\\vee y)\\wedge z\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1472,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2893","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-order11-modular-lattice.md|58-df-zfc-order11-modular-lattice]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","79109424a5779d49"]}